# design/ = the design project's code, verbatim. Their docs and data never
# enter git (their project has none of our sanitization rules): a pull copies
# code files by hand, and these catch what slips.
design/docs/
design/data/*
!design/data/gen-graph.js
design/CLAUDE.md
design/DECISIONS.md
design/support.js
design/*-graph.js
design/*.json
design/*.png
design/*.md
